  "verdict": "void",
  "section": "105",
  "quote": "The only security deposit that a landlord may collect is a rent deposit collected in accordance with section 106.",
  "reason": "The Act prohibits landlords from collecting any security deposit other than a rent deposit to be applied to the last rent period. Therefore, a clause requiring a refundable damage deposit is inconsistent with section 105 and is void under section 4."
}

